{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45381","headline":"奉和颜鲁公真卿落玄真子舴艋舟歌 · 皎然","name":"奉和颜鲁公真卿落玄真子舴艋舟歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沧浪子後玄真子，冥冥钓隐江之汜。\n刳木新成舴艋舟，诸侯落舟自兹始。\n得道身不系，无机舟亦闲。\n从水远逝兮任风还，朝五湖兮夕三山。\n停纶乍入芙蓉浦，击汰时过明月湾。\n太公取璜我不取，龙伯钓鳌我不钓。\n竹竿嫋嫋鱼簁簁，此中自得还自笑。\n汗漫一游何可期，後来谁遇冰雪姿。\n上古初闻出尧世，今朝还见在尧时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45381.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45381","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}